---
description: Maintainer workflow for Origin private fork and public GitHub mirror
alwaysApply: true
---

Read **docs/agents/PUBLIC_REPOSITORY.md** before publishing or merging.

- Develop on **Origin `main`**; do not push `main` to public GitHub.
- Publish via Origin Actions **Prepare public release branch** (`PUBLIC_MIRROR_TOKEN` secret); do not use MCP batch file uploads.
- Keep **AGENTS.md** framework-agnostic; put Cursor-only notes here or under **docs/agents/**.
- When **public GitHub `main`** has new commits (contributor PRs merged), **merge `public/main` into Origin `main`** before further internal work or publish.
- User-facing README on GitHub comes from **public/README.md** at publish time, not the internal root README.